# line comment with a 'quote', a b: 2 pair, and a 30s duration

/* block comment
   with a "quote" and # hash */

a: 1 # trailing comment

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["comment", "# line comment with a 'quote', a b: 2 pair, and a 30s duration\r"],

	["comment", "/* block comment\r\n   with a \"quote\" and # hash */"],

	["key", "a"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["number", "1"],
	["comment", "# trailing comment"]
]

----------------------------------------------------

Comments can appear wherever whitespace may go, and a comment holds strings and other syntax as plain text.
